<p id="A2.SS1.p1.8" class="ltx_p">where the second equality follows from <math id="A2.SS1.p1.m24" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\boldsymbol{A}\boldsymbol{\Theta^{*}}=\boldsymbol{b}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>𝑨</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝚯</mi><mo class="ltx_mathvariant_bold" mathvariant="bold">∗</mo></msup></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>𝒃</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\boldsymbol{A}\boldsymbol{\Theta^{*}}=\boldsymbol{b}</annotation></semantics></math>. We bound each term in the last expression separately. For the first term, note that</p>
<table id="A2.EGx19" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

